  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "## Changes since 9.0.x\n### All packages\n* Added Trimming Support\n* Added AoT Compatibility Support\n* Addressed compiler warnings\n\n### Main Package\n* Added ``PlatformNotSupportedException`` Throw static extension member methods\n* Moved ``WindowsFilePermission`` static extension members from DotPrimitives\n* Added FileInfo static extension method members ``HasExecutePermissions``, ``HasReadPermissionms``, and ``HasWritePermissions`` - These support both Unix and Windows based operating systems.\n* Moved Unix Numeric Permission notation parsing and Unix Rwx Symbolic notation parsing via static extension method members on UnixFileMode.\n* Updated Polyfill from 9.2.0 to 9.3.0\n* Added DateTime ``DaysInYear`` extension\n* Improved Argument Null and Out of Range throwing",
